<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>NHTML | 03 — Live Form</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/css/modern.css">
    <style>
        .form-group { margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
        label { display: block; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 6px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .field-hint { font-size: 0.72rem; margin-top: 6px; min-height: 18px; transition: color 0.3s; }
        .hint-ok   { color: var(--success); }
        .hint-err  { color: var(--error); }
        .hint-info { color: var(--text-dim); }
        input.valid   { border-color: var(--success); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(16,185,129,0.2); }
        input.invalid { border-color: var(--error);   box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(239,68,68,0.2); }
        .submit-btn { width: 100%; margin-top: 0.5rem; padding: 14px; font-size: 1rem; }
        .submit-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="glass-card" style="width: 420px;">
        <h1>📋 Live Form — Niveau 3</h1>
        <p style="font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--text-dim); margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
            Validation PHP en temps réel — zéro JS applicatif.
        </p>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Email</label>
            <input type="text" n-id="field_email" n-input="field_email" placeholder="vous@domaine.com">
            <div class="field-hint hint-info" n-id="hint_email">Saisissez votre email</div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Mot de passe</label>
            <input type="password" n-id="field_password" n-input="field_password" placeholder="8 caractères minimum">
            <div class="field-hint hint-info" n-id="hint_password">8 caractères, 1 chiffre requis</div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Nom d'utilisateur</label>
            <input type="text" n-id="field_username" n-input="field_username" placeholder="3–20 caractères, lettres et chiffres">
            <div class="field-hint hint-info" n-id="hint_username">Lettres, chiffres, underscore uniquement</div>
        </div>

        <button class="submit-btn" n-id="btn_submit" n-click="submit" disabled>CRÉER LE COMPTE</button>

        <div style="margin-top:1rem; font-size:0.65rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2); text-align:center;">
            NHTML Binary Protocol — Validation PHP on-input, patch SET_TEXT + SET_CLASS
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
